description: Feature work PRs target develop; main is for releases only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Pull request target

- Open every day-to-day / feature / bugfix PR against **`develop`**.
- **`main` is the release branch.** The only PR that may target `main` is promoting `develop` → `main` for a release.
- `gh pr create` must pass `--base develop` unless this is that release promotion.
- Never merge Audio Explorer, auto-tune, session-list, or other product work straight to `main`.
